From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: P80 builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Teclast P80: vm.swappiness 100 for zram

The tablet swaps only to zram; with the kernel default of 60 the kernel
drops more file pages (code) that the eMMC has to read back later.
Measured on LineageOS 24.0 with the same app-switching and UI scripts:
fewer janky frames in the notification shade (49 % instead of 56 %),
equal or faster app starts, more memory free after eight apps.
---
diff --git a/p80/p80.rc b/p80/p80.rc
--- a/p80/p80.rc
+++ b/p80/p80.rc
@@ -13,3 +13,10 @@
 # Without a relay port traced serves only its local sockets.
 on early-init
     setprop traced.relay_producer_port ""
+
+# zram (lz4, 75 % of RAM) is the only swap: prefer compressing idle anonymous memory over
+# dropping file pages that have to be read back from the eMMC. Measured on 24.0 against the
+# kernel's default of 60: notification shade 49 % instead of 56 % janky frames, apps start
+# as fast or faster, more free memory after switching through eight apps.
+on property:sys.boot_completed=1
+    write /proc/sys/vm/swappiness 100
